Hello,

As usual could you send us Christine's statements for the last tax year. This year she's asked us to do the full return, so we need both accounts - the rental one and the joint one she has with David - plus the property-by-property rental statements for her six lets so we can match the income.

Many thanks,
Michael Dawes
Dawes & Co


