ersonal banking, third-party requests)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": [\n    1,\n    2\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Request\",\n   \"predicate\": \"requests\",\n   \"value\": \"Statements for the rental account and the joint account for the tax year to 5 Apr 2026, plus property-by-property rental statements for six lets\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Michael Dawes (accountant)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Email (personal banking, third-party requests)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": [\n    3\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Sender email\",\n   \"predicate\": \"matches authority contact\",\n   \"value\": \"m.dawes@dawesandco.example matches the contact email on authority TPA-2024-00931\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Harrow & Vale Bank plc (case record)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Internal account view\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"asks\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": \"ask-1\",\n   \"text\": \"Statements for Christine's sole rental income account SYN-ACCT-16-1 for the tax year to 5 Apr 2026\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"ask-2\",\n   \"text\": \"Statements for the joint account SYN-ACCT-16-2 (Christine and David H.) for the tax year to 5 Apr 2026\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"ask-3\",\n   \"text\": \"Property-by-property rental statements for Christine's six lets\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\"\n  }\n ],\n \"unknowns\": [\n  \"Whether Christine really instructed Dawes & Co to get joint account information. Only the accountant says so; nothing from Christine is on file\",\n  \"Whether David H. (joint holder) consents to his account information going to Dawes & Co. No joint authority exists\",\n  \"Whether authority TPA-2024-00931 is still in force and has not been cancelled in writing\",\n  \"Whether the email really comes from Michael Dawes. The address matches the authority, but the sender has not been verified\",\n  \"The exact statement pe